[{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"由来东海百川尊，呼吸风云日月昏。\n隐隐三泉盘地轴，迢迢一水上天门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20625,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"地脉东南一线开，千流万?几时回。\n恰从瑶圃峰头去，又逐银河天上来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20626,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"方丈瀛洲一水傍，层城悬圃羽人乡。\n青云不散三花树，丹露长零五色浆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20627,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"白鹤东飞去不回，不知何处是蓬莱。\n汉皇虚筑迎年观，嬴帝空馀望海台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20628,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其八","author":"薛蕙","text":"王子题诗沧海岸，青鸾衔去海东边。\n龙女织成红锦字，仙人吹入紫箫篇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20629,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同王浚川海上杂歌九首 其九","author":"薛蕙","text":"长风吹出六龙车，夜坐天坛吸紫霞。\n自是神仙游海上，元非逐客卧天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20630,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五夜","author":"薛蕙","text":"病身愁思两萧条，乱帙残灯伴寂寥。\n但觉年光欺倦客，不知春色媚良宵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20631,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"夏日日长不可论，扶桑万里过昆崙。\n青天尽闭蛟龙雨，赤气遥冲虎豹门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20632,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"崆峒霜雪近幽燕，阊阖神仙捧御筵。\n舍人退食苦炎热，卑湿南方更可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20633,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"六月长安冰井台，雪宫杳杳风门开。\n江边此日苦消渴，阙下当年拜赐回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20634,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"天上火云不肯晴，城头霹雳浪多惊。\n终朝虚觉神灵聚，几日真看风雨生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20635,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"草堂低小只三间，日日炎蒸不暂闲。\n初惊沧海临汤谷，更讶朱陵入火山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20636,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"金壶玉盌露浆调，绿李黄梅冰水消。\n不奈五侯无限乐，可怜三伏为谁骄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20637,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"三年卧病楚江扉，六月池台满眼稀。\n玉笙楼上含烟雾，只许仙人醉酒归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20638,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其八","author":"薛蕙","text":"人间毒热不可当，想见山中楼阁凉。\n三十六洞何处好，欲借神仙白石床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20639,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其九","author":"薛蕙","text":"盘古山中太始雪，六月天边万里风。\n下界并愁炎火劫，丈人长对水晶宫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20640,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉同何大复苦热行十首 其十","author":"薛蕙","text":"太液甘泉冰雪生，君王避暑奏歌声。\n不须玉女招商曲，自有仙人苦热行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20641,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皇帝行幸南京歌十首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"白鹭洲边玉帐开，锦帆东指凤凰台。\n怪底鲸鲵窜江底，君王驾驭六龙来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20642,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皇帝行幸南京歌十首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"天风吹动翠云裘，坐看楼船下石头。\n江左重瞻天子气，金陵长作帝王州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20643,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皇帝行幸南京歌十首 其九","author":"薛蕙","text":"吴王雉翳春依草，宋帝羊车夜逐花。\n总是南朝旧时事，我皇行乐倍繁华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20644,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"皇帝行幸南京歌十首 其十","author":"薛蕙","text":"三月江南莺乱啼，江边桃叶映春堤。\n不是行宫淹北上，金陵花月使人迷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20645,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋夜待月","author":"薛蕙","text":"海上珠宫向夜开，银河初转绿云来。\n遥闻仙乐生林壑，暗觉天香拂酒杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20646,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"乌石山中生紫芝，少谷先生归去时。\n赠君试作远游曲，较似仙人碧落辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20647,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"阙下屡移称病书，知尔不复少踌躇。\n海上但留双玉舄，山中谁见五云车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20648,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"五岳之山君遍过，名山不比浙江多。\n赤城直上仙人阙，天姥斜连织女河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20649,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"赤城宛转石为梁，云里振衣千仞冈。\n闻道台州老太守，为君先已筑丹房。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20650,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"太白山人高士流，十年不出卧沧洲。\n尔去相逢托相讯，南来傥许共扁舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20651,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"越中会稽天下无，金庭玉室是仙都。\n即向山阴觅芝草，还从禹穴探灵符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20652,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"丹山赤水足华滋，雁荡龙湫更自奇。\n招隐顿怜君去早，移文应笑我来迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20653,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其八","author":"薛蕙","text":"镜湖绿水画难成，五月南风菡萏生。\n越女舟中歌白苧，道人醉卧酒船行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20654,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其九","author":"薛蕙","text":"海门东去片帆归，却傍三山开钓矶。\n人间物色那能见，空向青天望少微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20655,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"远游曲十首赠郑继之 其十","author":"薛蕙","text":"天地今经几劫灰，区区人世只堪哀。\n莫漫著书抛岁月，径须餐玉访蓬莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20656,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪七绝 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"流风回雪满蓬莱，堕叶飘花海上来。\n隐隐珠宫连月起，亭亭银阙向云开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20657,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪七绝 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"苑外楼台绕狭邪，雪中歌吹竞繁华。\n丽人对舞明珠佩，侠客争驰白鼻騧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20658,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪七绝 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"曾闻楚客阳春曲，拟赋燕京子夜篇。\n假藉彩毫分气象，直惭白雪斗婵娟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20659,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读金刚经","author":"薛蕙","text":"一卷天华罗梵筴，千年马耳射春风。\n知言安得蒙庄子，具眼惟闻陈了翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20660,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"书老子解后","author":"薛蕙","text":"柱下遗编久翳如，偶将管穴赞玄虚。\n当年己自无知者，何事而今更著书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20661,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春","author":"薛蕙","text":"树梢红润水波明，新鸟啼多百啭声。\n从此小园增物色，杖藜日日看春生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20662,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓寒","author":"薛蕙","text":"洞门风急薜萝斜，满院疏桐洗露华。\n一榻晓寒难稳卧，道人赖是服朝霞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20663,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋看月二首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"穆穆金波端正月，寥寥碧落蔚蓝天。\n松林阴映石床净，宴坐焚香骨已仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20664,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋看月二首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"秋光秋兴最相关，中夜中林犹未还。\n似闻鸾鹤青冥外，遥见楼台桂影间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20665,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"昨夜雨声喧菌阁，今朝花影照柴扉。\n正欲相邀社中客，酒家不肯当春衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20666,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"草芽半吐参差碧，花蕊初开浅淡红。\n安得黄金高北斗，尽输青帝买东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20667,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"二月黄鹂满树飞，歌喉宛啭世间稀。\n谢公虽有东山妓，不及侬家金缕衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20668,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"梁间燕子甚微眇，岁岁来过旧主人。\n不似翟公门下客，交情浅薄最堪嗔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20669,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"早岁脩辞拟草玄，中年探赜强知天。\n尔来懒慢太无似，只有楞伽堆案前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20670,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"屈指行年垂半百，拘检还如少小时。\n可怜龊龊窭人子，争似堂堂豪侠儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20671,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"散才犹足拟仙才，懊恼青春白发催。\n空对玉壶连月醉，漫拈綵笔记花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20672,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其八","author":"薛蕙","text":"劳劳各为百年身，草草旋成一聚尘。\n借问煎熬催白首，何如潦倒醉青春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20673,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其九","author":"薛蕙","text":"东园红梅馀几何，西园绯桃开又多。\n春光相挠不相置，醉杀花前金叵罗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20674,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其十","author":"薛蕙","text":"小桥映带小池塘，垂柳垂杨凡几行。\n莺莺燕燕最相称，雨雨风风总不妨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20675,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其十一","author":"薛蕙","text":"魏紫姚黄何似春，玉环飞燕定前身。\n谪仙解赋清平调，不道宫中妒杀人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20676,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日漫兴十二首 其十二","author":"薛蕙","text":"柳绕柴门竹绕轩，花能含笑鸟能言。\n何人文似卿云辈，试为抽毫赋小园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20677,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏成五绝 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"束发从师王浚川，文章衣钵幸相传。\n尔时评我李何似，白首摧颓只自怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20678,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏成五绝 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"弱冠粗窥万卷馀，壮年益览百家书。\n探珠赤水方亲见，披雾青天果不虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20679,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏成五绝 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"雅知文艺未为尊，次第沿流直讨源。\n不但学诗高一格，信然闻道小群言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20680,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏成五绝 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"知己今无贺宾客，论文谁似鲍参军。\n夜光未剖千金璞，汗血空随万马群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20681,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"閒倚阑干看柳条，可怜浑似董娇娆。\n东风何处吹桃李，空费心情学舞腰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20682,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"年年永巷掩朱扉，愁惯多愁却渐稀。\n偶对春风见花落，一双玉箸堕罗衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20683,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"玉阶簇簇海榴红，画阁泠泠菡萏风。\n闷卷珠帘看日影，鸳鸯相倚绿池中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20684,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"绣帘风动水精光，小苑离宫好纳凉。\n卢橘杨梅零落尽，只闻清跸幸昭阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20685,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"荷花布锦柳垂丝，一片丹青太液池。\n御榻独留清暑殿，宫娥空唱采莲词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"翡翠楼中落日明，芙蓉帐里嫩寒生。\n人间一种清秋色，偏到深宫别有情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其八","author":"薛蕙","text":"落叶无风满地沟，袖中团扇早知秋。\n宝奁红粉都抛却，展转空床尽日愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其十一","author":"薛蕙","text":"白雪霏霏拂玉阑，银釭耿耿夜漫漫。\n熏笼火冷青绫薄，不管娉婷不耐寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词十二首 其十二","author":"薛蕙","text":"翠袖年年积泪痕，罗帏夜夜忆君恩。\n纱窗月色不成梦，金井乌啼更断魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新春赏梅花作","author":"薛蕙","text":"落梅树下携酒卮，便与东风预作期。\n从今日日觅花饮，直到荼蘼开尽时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"溪滨","author":"薛蕙","text":"柴门咫尺即溪滨，赋得新诗似写真。\n蒲芽短短桃花水，燕子飞飞杨柳春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20692,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日宴南园","author":"薛蕙","text":"谢公携妓踏春晖，撩乱桃花落舞衣。\n池边偶学流觞饮，月下真成倒载归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20693,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日郊居","author":"薛蕙","text":"竹里柴门尽日开，半园芳草半青苔。\n恨无名酒山翁醉，畏有高轩俗客来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读李空同诗","author":"薛蕙","text":"可怜词客李空同，治第筑园学富翁。\n地下定遭刘主笑，我犹如此况如公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上巳日简诸友","author":"薛蕙","text":"涡濑萦回曲水流，春风荡漾羽觞浮。\n群贤酣畅兰亭会，只少山人许远游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山馆","author":"薛蕙","text":"山馆萧条客到稀，幽人閒暇坐披衣。\n日长燕子丁宁语，风静杨花自在飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小阁","author":"薛蕙","text":"曲几匡床小阁深，数函图籍一张琴。\n不闻世上諠哗事，自爱林间宴坐心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"嘲杨花","author":"薛蕙","text":"陌上杨花四散飞，千蹊万径巧因依。\n莫矜风便纵横去，会见途穷寂寞归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮","author":"薛蕙","text":"祗愁春暮减春光，谁道春光未渠央。\n芍药如云仍著色，荼蘼似雪更生香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杏花","author":"薛蕙","text":"东风作意辨年华，先酿轻红上杏花。\n杨柳初生燕初到，春光并属野人家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉","author":"薛蕙","text":"西风惨澹自堪愁，赖有秾华殿晚秋。\n莫遣烟霜妒花萼，好留云锦照汀洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花","author":"薛蕙","text":"岁晚山空不见人，鸟啼花落倍伤神。\n玉颜弃置冰霜里，让取群英竞好春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]